the bunker for safety reasons.

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.589
He said, oh, I did.

00:00:40.589 --> 00:00:45.809
I decided I wanted to go down and inspect
the bunker on that particular day.

00:00:45.809 --> 00:00:49.010
This was what he told Fox and Friends a few
days after the incident.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:50.010
We don't know.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.510
Leland Verrett Vittert reporting.

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:52.510
No problem.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:53.510
We got dark.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:54.510
Huge problem.

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.300
