there were so worried they brought you downstairs

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.239
in the White House to a bunker.

00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:01.679
What could you tell me Sunday night?

00:01:01.679 --> 00:01:03.489
Sunday night was like for you and your family?

00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:05.800
Well, it was a false report.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:11.980
I was down I went down during the day and
I was there for a tiny little short period

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.730
of time and was much more for an inspection.

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:15.670
There was no problem during the day.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:21.120
The problem I saw, Leland got whacked pretty
