00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.960
And I go down.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.140
I've gone down two or three times.

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.130
All for inspection.

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:32.930
And you go there someday.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:35.320
You may need it, but you go there.

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.160
And I went down.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.160
I looked at it.

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:39.160
It was during the day.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:40.530
It was not a problem.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:43.230
And I read about it just like a big thing.

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:44.460
There was never a problem.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:45.640
We never had a problem.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.590
No, nobody ever came close to giving us a
problem.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:55.970
The Secret Service does an unbelievable job
of maintaining control in the White House.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:56.970
Right.

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.070
Trump claiming that he regularly inspects
